Every song page for each exact artist must be read so the maximum play count can be computed globally rather than inferred from one page; song IDs allow duplicate collaborative results to be consolidated.

```python
songs_by_id = {}
for artist_id in velvet_echo_artist_ids:
    song_page_index = 0
    while True:
        song_page = apis.spotify.search_songs(artist_id=artist_id, page_index=song_page_index, sort_by="-play_count")
        if not song_page:
            break
        for song in song_page:
            songs_by_id[song["song_id"]] = song
        song_page_index += 1
velvet_echo_songs = list(songs_by_id.values())
print([{"song_id": song["song_id"], "title": song["title"], "play_count": song["play_count"], "artists": song["artists"]} for song in velvet_echo_songs])
